{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["ראשיכם אל תפרעו וגו׳ — thus he said to Elazar and to Itamar: even though you are ordinary priests and are not commanded in letting the hair loose and in tearing garments, for this applies to the High Priest and not to an ordinary priest — today you are like the High Priest for your generations. Why? —"], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {0 "The lemma's וגו׳ (etc.) indicates the verse continues beyond the quoted words; rendered as 'and etc.' is not added since the abbreviation is retained in the lemma per the Hebrew. The phrase לדורת is unusual (expected: לדורות); translated literally as 'for your generations.'"}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:48:31.227809044Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}